Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:42.90,Translation,TR,0,0,0,notkara,{\an2\fad(150,150)\fscx100\fscy100))}tayfan her zaman arkanı kollayacak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.27,0:00:47.00,Translation,TR,0,0,0,notkara,{\an2\fad(150,150)\fscx100\fscy100))}Mutlak karanlığın karşısında bile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:48.58,Translation,TR,0,0,0,notkara,{\an2\fad(150,150)\fscx100\fscy100))}Hadi, CESUR OL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:49.99,Translation,TR,0,0,0,notkara,{\an2\fad(150,150)\fscx100\fscy100))}İyi olacağız
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:53.78,Translation,TR,0,0,0,notkara,{\an2\fad(150,150)\fscx100\fscy100))}Birlikteyken asla yenilmeyiz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:56.77,Translation,TR,0,0,0,notkara,{\an2\fad(150,150)\fscx100\fscy100))}Sınırları olmayan haritayı aç ve sonra
