Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:04.21,Translation,TR,0,0,0,notkara,{\an2\fad(150,150)\fscx100\fscy100))}Tüm harika yolculuklar tek bir adımla başlar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:05.22,Translation,TR,0,0,0,notkara,{\an2\fad(150,150)\fscx100\fscy100))}HAYAL ET
